  "speech_vs_text": 0.92,
  "boundary_margin": 0.212,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 96,
  "start": 288.38,
  "end": 290.314,
  "te": "And who will sit where you're sitting?",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.87,
  "boundary_margin": 0.212,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 97,
  "start": 290.818,
  "end": 296.994,
  "te": "In August twenty twenty-five, India sent its first two trained people down in a French sub called Nautile.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.01,
  "boundary_margin": 0.355,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 98,
  "start": 297.425,
  "end": 301.215,
  "te": "Raju Ramesh, a scientist, reached about four thousand metres.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.99,
  "boundary_margin": 0.115,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 99,
  "start": 301.612,
  "end": 307.101,
  "te": "The next day, Commander Jatinder Pal Singh, a retired Navy officer, reached about five thousand.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.89,
  "boundary_margin": 0.115,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 100,
  "start": 307.54,
  "end": 309.735,
  "te": "So is Matsya ready, do you think?",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.21,
  "boundary_margin": 0.338,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 101,
  "start": 310.192,
  "end": 310.758,
  "te": "Not quite.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.06,
  "boundary_margin": 0.454,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 102,
  "start": 311.12,
  "end": 312.371,
  "te": "There's one more problem.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.94,
  "boundary_margin": 0.921,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 103,
  "start": 312.814,
  "end": 314.811,
  "te": "This ball is only part of the sub.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.04,
  "boundary_margin": 0.283,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 104,
  "start": 315.25,
  "end": 318.801,
  "te": "Around it go batteries, lights, motors and arms.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 1.4,
  "boundary_margin": 0.283,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 105,
  "start": 319.105,
  "end": 322.363,
  "te": "Put it all together, and the whole thing sinks like a stone.",
  "en": "",
  "speech_vs_text": 0.92,
  "boundary_margin": 0.397,
  "confidence": "high"
 },
 {
  "line": 106,
  "start": 322.754,
